{"text": "From: Fenella Ogilvie <f.ogilvie@thwaitependlebury.example>\nTo: Dafydd Llewellyn-Price <dafydd.lp@fellmail.example>\nCc: anjali.raghunathan@fellmail.example\nDate: Thu, 6 Nov 2025 16:48:09 +0000\nSubject: RE: 14 Tanner's Yard - engagement, ID and money on account (our ref FO/LLE0412/1)\n\nDear Dafydd and Anjali,\n\nThank you for instructing Thwaite & Pendlebury Solicitors LLP on your purchase of 14 Tanner's Yard, Kendal, Cumbria LA9 4HT at £284,950. Our client care letter is attached; the key points are below.\n\n1. Fees. Our fixed fee is £1,150 plus VAT (£1,380.00 in all). Searches will be about £312.40 and the Land Registry fee £150. On the figures you gave, no SDLT is payable as first-time buyers.\n\n2. Money on account. Please send £500.00 before we order searches, to our client account only:\n     Sort code 97-26-60   Account 02659322\n     IBAN GB15 NWBK 9726 6002 6593 22 (only needed if paying from abroad)\n     Reference LLE0412\n   We will NEVER change these details by email. If you receive anything saying otherwise, ring me on 01632 960147 before sending a penny.\n\n3. ID. Thank you for the scans. For our records: Dafydd's passport no. 533402917 (expires 14/08/2031), driving licence LLEWE801124D99XK; Anjali's passport no. Z4418830 and biometric residence permit ZU9041127. Anjali, as you hold a Skilled Worker visa, the lender will want to see at least 12 months left on it. Yours runs to 2 March 2028, so that is fine.\n\n4. Mortgage. Ravenglass Building Society have issued the offer (roll no. RBS/7741209-3) for £256,455. The balance of the deposit from you will be £28,495, part of it from Dafydd's Help to Buy ISA.\n\n5. Timing. The sellers' agent, Kieran Musgrove at Fellside Estates, is pressing for exchange by Friday 28 November and completion on 12 December 2025. We have the Form TA6 and are following the Law Society Conveyancing Protocol.\n\nWe are authorised and regulated by the SRA. I am in the office Monday to Thursday; my mobile is 07700 900152.\n\nKind regards,\nFenella\n\nFenella Ogilvie | Associate Solicitor, Residential Property\nThwaite & Pendlebury | 3 Finkle Street, Kendal LA9 4AB | www.thwaitependlebury.example\n\n> On 5 Nov 2025, at 21:14, Dafydd Llewellyn-Price wrote:\n> hi fenella, passports + my licence attached. anjalis BRP is the pink card, both sides.\n> NI numbers if you need them - mine PB 41 72 09 C, hers SK 60 31 88 A\n> dobs: me 24.11.1980, anj 9 Jan 87\n> we're still at Flat 3, 27 Stricklandgate til the move. can we pay the 500 by card? kieran says the sellers want the 28th\n> cheers, D", "kind": "Email", "detail": "417 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Fenella Ogilvie", "Dafydd Llewellyn-Price", "Anjali Raghunathan", "Kieran Musgrove", "fenella", "anjalis", "kieran"], "companies": ["Thwaite & Pendlebury Solicitors LLP", "Thwaite Pendlebury", "Fellmail", "Ravenglass Building Society", "Fellside Estates", "SRA", "Fenella Ogilvie", "Thwaite & Pendlebury", "Kendal LA9 4AB"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Kendal", "Cumbria", "LA9 4HT", "Tanner's Yard", "Flat 3", "27 Stricklandgate"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["ID", "Skilled Worker visa", "Help to Buy ISA", "NI numbers"], "names": ["Fenella", "Dafydd", "Anjali", "Kieran", "anjalis"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.0999999940395355, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 21, "text": "Fenella Ogilvie", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Fenella Ogilvie"}, {"start": 23, "end": 58, "text": "f.ogilvie@thwaitependlebury.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern"